@startuml
actor 主函数 as Main
participant 数据库 as DB
participant "get_book_details 函数" as GetBookDetails
participant "HTTP 请求" as HTTPRequest
participant "HTML 解析" as HTMLParser
participant "数据保存" as DataSave

Main -> DB: 从数据库获取书籍ID和描述
loop 对每本书籍
    Main -> GetBookDetails: 创建线程并执行
    activate GetBookDetails
    GetBookDetails -> HTTPRequest: 构建URL并发起请求
    activate HTTPRequest
    HTTPRequest -> HTMLParser: 接收并解析HTML
    deactivate HTTPRequest
    activate HTMLParser
    HTMLParser -> GetBookDetails: 返回解析后的数据
    deactivate HTMLParser
    GetBookDetails -> DataSave: 将数据保存到数据库
    deactivate GetBookDetails
end
DataSave -> DB: 数据存储
@enduml
